# Documentation
packages/**/docs/

# SDD canonical specs for @webex/internal-plugin-call-ai-summary are tracked
# documentation, not build output. Git cannot re-include a file under an
# excluded directory, so each directory is un-excluded before its contents.
!packages/@webex/internal-plugin-call-ai-summary/docs/
!packages/@webex/internal-plugin-call-ai-summary/docs/**
!packages/@webex/internal-plugin-call-ai-summary/src/docs/
!packages/@webex/internal-plugin-call-ai-summary/src/docs/**
# The pinned repo-standards template snapshot records which templates
# generated those specs, so it is tracked alongside them.
!packages/@webex/internal-plugin-call-ai-summary/.sdd/templates/repo-standards/docs/
!packages/@webex/internal-plugin-call-ai-summary/.sdd/templates/repo-standards/docs/**

